>\n\n\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">Logged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">Sanded</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">Planked</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">~$200/tree</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">~$22.5/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">~$28.25/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.45.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">December 10th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\nThe <b>Candy Cane Tree</b> is a limited-time tree that was added in <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log/Version_1.45.0\" title=\"Update Log/Version 1.45.0\">v1.45.0</a>, replacing all of the trees that would normally spawn in a meteor crash site. The tree was reintroduced in v1.71.0 as a limited time tree that spawned around the map.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 280px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fb/Spearmint_Candycane.png/revision/latest?cb=20251207110700\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Spearmint Candycane\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"280\" height=\"231\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Spearmint Candycane.png\" data-image-key=\"Spearmint_Candycane.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fb/Spearmint_Candycane.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/280?cb=20251207110700\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fb/Spearmint_Candycane.png/revision/latest?cb=20251207110700\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Spearmint Candycane\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fb/Spearmint_Candycane.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/280?cb=20251207110700\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"280\" height=\"231\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Spearmint Candycane.png\" data-image-key=\"Spearmint_Candycane.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fb/Spearmint_Candycane.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/280?cb=20251207110700\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Spearmint_Candycane.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Spearmint Candycane</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Christmas events after v1.71.0 include the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Spearmint_Candy_Cane\" title=\"Spearmint Candy Cane\">Spearmint Candycane Tree</a></b> which is *slightly* rarer. It has a green appearance and sells for about  674 ❄️ more than the Red Candycane tree. (Logged) \n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>The Candy Cane Tree is a large curving tree with no leaves. Its durability is similar to that of a <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Tree\" title=\"Magma Tree\">Magma Tree</a> when struck by any axe. However, if the <a href=\"/wiki/Festive_Axe\" title=\"Festive Axe\">Festive Axe</a> is used to cut the Candy Cane Tree, it gains an <a href=\"/wiki/Emberbane\" title=\"Emberbane\">Emberbane</a>-like effect where it can chop the tree in only a few hits.\n</p><p>Sanded and planked Candy Cane has a deep pink hue similar to <a href=\"/wiki/Red_Maple\" title=\"Red Maple\">Red Maple</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>(v1.45.x) When hovered over, the name of the wood appears as \"candy_cane\", as the string was not properly localized at the time.</li></ul>\n<!-- 